# weather-ai-mcp - Auto-trigger Rules

When the user asks about weather, use weather-ai-mcp tools: get_current_conditions, get_forecast, get_historical_weather, get_agricultural_alerts, get_severe_weather_warnings

> Weather intelligence tools - current conditions, forecasts, historical data, agricultural alerts, severe warnings

Install: `pip install weather-ai-mcp`

